hadiths[36]{hadithnumber,text}:
"452","Hadith: Kharijab bin Hudhafah (radiyallahu anhu) rivayti karte hain ki: \Allah's Messenger (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) humari taraf aap aaye aur farmaya: 'Allah ta'ala ne ek aisi Namaz tumhari madad ke zariye diya hai jo tumhare liye laal utton se behtar hai: yeh Al-Witr hai"","" jise Allah ne tumhare liye Isha ki Namaz ke baad se Fajr ki Namaz ke waqt tak ke liye muqarrar kiya hai.'\"""""""
"453","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney Zohar paanch rakat padhi to aap sey puchha gaya : kya namaz badha di gaee hai?  yani chaar ke bajaey paanch rakat kar di gaee hai) to aap ne salam pherney key baad do sajdey kiye. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"454","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney sahoo key dono sajdey baat karney key baad kiye. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ibne-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan sahih hai padhi. , padhi. 2- is bab mein Muawiya , Abdullah bin Jaafar aur Abu-Hurera (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain."
"455","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney saho key dono sajdey salam key baad kiye. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- (abu-Huraira (Raziallahu anhu) ki) ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, 2- usey Ayub aur deegar kaee logon ney bhi ibn Sirin sey riwayat kya hai, 3- ibne-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan sahih hai, 4- ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai, wo kehtey hain ke jab aadmi Zohar bhool kar paanch rakat padh ley to uski namaz durust hai wo saho key do sajdey kar ley agar-che wo chauthi (rakat) mein na betha ho, yehi Shafai, Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka bhi qol hai, 5- aur baaz log kehtey hain ke jab Zohar paanch rakat padh ley aur chauthi rakat mein na betha ho to uski namaz faasid ho jaeygi. ye qol Sufiyan Sory aur baaz koofiyon ka hai."
"456","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney unhen namaz padhaai aap sey saho ho gaya, to aap ney do sajdey kiye phir tashahud padha , phir salam phera. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai, 2- Abdul-Wahab saqafii, Hushem aur unkey ilawa kaee aur logon ney b-tareeq : «Khalid Haza an abi Qalaba» ye hadees zara lambey siyaaq key sath riwayat ki hai, aur wo yehi Imran bin Husain (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees hai ke Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney Asr mein sirf teen hi rakat padh kar salam pher diya to eik aadmi utha jisey « kharbaaq » kaha jata tha (aur usney puchha : kya namaz mein kami kar di gaee hai, ya aap bhool gaey hain) 3- sajda saho key tashahud key silsiley mein ehle-ilm key darmyan ikhtilaf hai. baaz kehtey hain ke sajda saho key baad tashahud padheyga aur salam phereyga. aur baaz kehtey ke sajda saho mein tashahud aur salam nahin hai aur jab salam sey pehley sajda saho karey to tashahud na padhey, yehi Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka qol hai ke jab salam sey pehley sajda saho karey to tashahud na padhey (ikhtilaf to salam key baad mein hai )."
"457","mainey abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey kaha : hum mein sey koi namaz padhta hai aur ye nahin janta ke usney kitni rakat padhi hain (ya wo kya kerey?) to abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha ke Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya hai : '' jab tum mein sey koi shakhs namaz padhey aur ye na jaan sakey ke kitni padhi hai? to wo bethey bethey saho key do sajdey kar ley''. (yaqeeni baat par bana karney key baad) Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Usman , ibne-Masood , Aaisha , Abu-Hurera waghera (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain, 3- ye hadees abu-Saeed sey deegar kaee sanadon sey bhi marvi hai, 4- Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey ye bhi marvi hai ke aap ney farmaya : '' jab tum sey kisi ko eik aur do mein shak ho jaey to usey eik hi maaney aur jab do aur teen mein shak ho to usey do maaney aur salam pherney sey pehley saho key do sajdey karey ''. usi par hamarey as-haab ( muhaddeseen (ka amal hai padhi. aur baaz ehle-ilm kehtey hain ke jab kisi ko apni namaz mein shubha ho jaey aur wo na jaan sakey ke usney kitni rakat padhi hain? to wo phir sey lotaye padhi. ."
"458","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' aadmi key paas shetan uski namaz mein aata hai aur usey shubha mein dal deta hai, yahan tak aadmi nahin jaan paata ke usney kitni rakat padhi hain? chunanche tum mein sey kisi ko agar is qism ka shubha mehsus ho to usey chahiye ke wo bethey bethey saho key do sajdey kar ley '' padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"459","mainey Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko ye farmatey huye suna : '' jab koi shakhs namaz bhool jaey aur ye na jaan sakey ke usney eik rakat padhi hai ya do ? to aisi surat mein usey eik maaney , aur agar wo ye na ja sakey ke usney do padhi hai ya teen to aisi surat mein do par bina kerey. aur agar wo ye na jaan sakey ke usney teen padhi hai ya chaar to teen par bina kerey. aur salam pherney sey pehley saho key do sajdey kar ley''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, 2- ye hadees Abdur-Rehman bin Auf (Raziallahu anhu) sey aur bhi sanadon sey marvi hai."
"460","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam (zohar ya Asr ki) do rakat padh kar (muqtadiyon ki taraf) paltey to zul-yadain ney aap sey puchha : Allah key Rasool ! kya namaz kam kar di gaee hai ya aap bhool gaey hain? to aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney puchha : '' kya zul-yadain sach keh rahey hain?'' logon ney arz kya : haan (aap ney do hi rakat padhi hain) to Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam khadey huye aur aakhiri dono rakatein padhein phir salam pheraa, phir Allahu-akbar kaha, phir apney pehley sajda ki tarah ya us sey kuch lamba sajda kya, phir Allahu-akbar kaha aur sar uthaya, phir apney usi sajda ki tarah ya us sey kuch lamba sajda kya. (yani sajda saho kya) Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Imran bin Husain , ibne-Umar , zul-yadain (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain, 3- is hadees key barey mein ehle-ilm key beech ikhtilaf hai. baaz ehle-koofa kehtey hain ke jab koi namaz mein bhool kar ya la-ilmi mein ya kisi bhi wajeh sey baat kar bethey to usey naey sirey sey namaz dohrani hogi. wo is hadees mein mazkur waqiey ki taaweel ye kartey hain ke ye waqia namaz mein baat cheet karney ki hurmat sey pehley ka hai, 4- rahey Imam Shafai to unhoney is hadees ko sahih jana hai aur usi key mutabiq unhoney fatwa diya hai, unka kehna hai ke ye hadees is hadees sey ziyada sahih hai jo rozey daar key silsiley mein marvi hai ke jab wo bhool kar kha ley to is par rozey ki qaza nahin, kyonkey wo Allah ka diya huwa rizq hai. Shafai kehtey hain ke un logon ney rozey daar key qasdan aur bhool kar khaney mein jo tafriq ki hai wo Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees ki wajeh sey hai, 5- Imam Ahmed Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees key mutalliq kehtey hain ke agar Imam ye samajh kar ke uski namaz puri ho chuki hai koi baat kar ley phir usey malum ho ke uski namaz puri nahin hui hai to wo apni namaz puri kar ley, aur jo Imam key peechey muqtadi ho aur baat kar ley aur ye janta ho ke abhi kuch namaz uskey zimma baqi hai to is par lazim hai ke wo usey dobara padhey, unhoney is baat sey daleel pakdi hai ke Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key zamaney mein faraaiz kam ya ziyada kiye ja saktey they. aur zul-yadain (Raziallahu anhu) ney jo baat ki thi to wo mehaz us wajeh sey ke unhen yaqin tha ke namaz kamil ho chuki hai aur ab kisi key liye is tarah baat karna jayez nahin jo zul-yadain key liye jayez ho gaya tha, kyonkey ab faraaiz mein kami beshi nahin ho sakti padhi. , 6- Ahmed ka qol bhi kuch usi sey milta-julta hai, Is-haq bin Raahviya ney bhi is baab mein Ahmed jaisi baat kahi hai."
"461","mainey Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey puchha : kya Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apney jooton mein namaz padhtey they? to unhoney kaha : haan padhtey they . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Abdullah bin Masood , Abdullah bin abi Habiba, Abdullah bin Amr , Amr bin Hures , Shaddad bin Aus Saqafi, Abu-Hurera (Raziallauh anhum) aur Ata sey bhi jo bani Sheeba key eik fard they ahadees aai hain, 3- aur usi par ehle-ilm ka amal hai."
"462","Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Fajr aur maghrib mein qunoot padhtey they padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Bara ki hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Ali , Anas , Abu-Hurera , ibne-Abbas , aur khafaaf bin Ema bin Rahza Ghifaari (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain, 3- Fajr mein qunoot padhney key silsiley mein ehle-ilm key darmiyan ikhtilaf hai. Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey baaz ehle-ilm ki raey Fajr mein qunoot padhney ki hai, yehi Malik aur Shafai ka qol hai, 4- Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya kehtey hain ke Fajr mein qunoot na padhey, illa ye ke musalmanon par koi musibat nazil hui ho to aisi surat mein Imam ko chahiye ke musalmanon key lashkar key liye dua kerey."
"463","mainey apney baap ( Tariq bin Ashim (Raziallahu anhu)) sey arz kya : abba jaan ! aap ney Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) , abu-Bakar , umr aur Usman (Raziallauh anhum) key peechey namaz padhi hai aur Ali (Raziallahu anhu) key peechey bhi yahan koofa mein taqriban paanch baras tak padhi hai, kya ye log ( barabar ( qunoot (Qunoote-Nazila) padhtey they? to unhoney kaha : merey betey ! ye bid-at hai padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, 2- aksar ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai. aur Sufiyan Sory kehtey hain ke agar Fajr mein qunoot padhey to bhi achcha hai aur agar na padhey to bhi achcha hai, wesay unhoney pasand usi baat ko kya hai ke na padhey aur ibne-Mubarak Fajr mein qunoot padhney ko durust nahin samajhtey."
"464","Mujhey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney ye kalimaat sikhaey jinhen main witr mein padha karun, wo kalimaat ye hain : (اللهم اهدني فيمن هديت وعافني فيمن عافيت وتولني فيمن توليت وبارك لي فيما أعطيت وقني شر ما قضيت فإنك تقضي wala يقضى عليك وإنه لا يذل من واليت تباركت ربنا وتعاليت) ''aey Allah ! mujhey hidayat dey kar un logon mein shamil farma jinhen tu ney hidayat sey nawaza hai, mujhey aafiyat dey kar un logon mein shamil farma jinhen tu ney aafiyat bakhshi hai, meri sarparasti farma kar , un logon mein shamil farma jin ki tu ney sarparasti ki hai, aur jo kuchh tu ney mujhey ata farmaya hai is mein barkat ata farma , aur jis shar ka tu ney faisla farma diya hai us sey mujhey mehfooz rakh , yaqinan faisla tu hi sadir (jaari) farmata hai, terey khilaf faisla sadir (jaari) nahin kiya ja sakta , aur jis ka to wali ho wo kabhi zaleel aur khuwar nahin ho sakta , aey hamarey rab ! to bahut barkat wala aur bahut buland aur baala hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan hai, 2- isey hum sirf isi sanad sey yani Abul Horaa Sa'di ki riwayat sey jantey hain, inka naam Rabeea bin Sheban hai. 3- merey ilm mein witr key qunoot key silsiley mein is sey behtar koi aur chiz Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey marvi (riwayat hui) ho malum nahin. 4- is bab mein Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey bhi riwayat hai, 5- ehle-ilm ka witr key qunoot mein ikhtilaf hai. Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ka khayal hai ke witr mein qunoot purey saal hai, aur unhoney rukoo sey pehley qunoot padhna pasand kiya hai, aur yehi baaz ehle-ilm ka qol hai Sufiyan Sory , ibne-Mubarak , Is-haq aur ehle-Koofa bhi yehi kehtey hain. 6- Ali bin abi Talib (Raziallahu anhu) sey marvi (riwayat hui) hai ke wo sirf Ramzan key nisf (aadha), aakhir mein qunoot padhtey they, aur rukoo key baad padhtey they. 7- baaz ehle-ilm isi taraf gaey hain, Shafai aur Ahmed bhi yehi kehtey hain."
"465","mainey Rasool akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key peechey namaz padhi , mujhey chheenk aai to mainey « الحمد لله حمدا كثيرا طيبا مباركا فيه مباركا عليه كما يحب ربنا ويرضى » kaha jab Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) namaz padh kar paltey to aap ney puchha : '' namaz mein kon bol raha tha? '' to kisi ney jawab nahin diya, phir aap ney yehi baat dobara poochhii ke '' namaz mein kon bol raha tha? '' is baar bhi kisi ney koi jawab nahin diya, phir aap ney yehi baat teesri baar poochhi ke '' namaz mein kon bol raha tha? ''Rifaa bin Raafey (Raziallahu anhu) ney arz kya : main tha Allah key Rasool ! aap ney puchha : ''tum ney kya kaha tha? '' unhoney kaha : yun kaha tha « الحمد لله حمدا كثيرا طيبا مباركا فيه مباركا عليه كما يحب ربنا ويرضى » to Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ney farmaya : '' qism hai us zaat ki jis key haath mein meri jaan hai ke tees sey zayed farishtey is par jhaptey ke usey kon ley kar aasman par chadhey ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Rifaa ki hadees Hasan hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Anas, Wayl bin Hajar aur Aamir bin Rabee (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain, 3- baaz ehle-ilm key nazdik ye waqia nafl ka hai padhi. isliye ke Tabe-een mein sey kaee logon ka kehna hai ke jab aadmi farz namaz mein chheenkey to Alhamdulillah apney ji mein kahey us sey ziyada ki un logon ney ijazat nahin di."
"466","hum Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key peechey namaz mein baat cheet kar liya kartey they, aadmi apney sath waley sey baat kar liya karta tha, yahan tak ke aayate-karima : « وقوموا لله قانتين » '' Allah key liye baa adab khadey raha karo '' nazil hui to hamen khamosh rehney ka hukm diya gaya aur baat karney sey rok diya gaya . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Zaid bin Arqam (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein ibne-Masood aur Muawiya bin Hakam Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi ahadees aai hain, 3- aksar ehle-ilm ka amal isi par hai ke aadmi namaz mein qasdan ya bhool kar guftgu kar ley to namaz dohraaey. Sufiyan Sory , ibne-Mubarak aur ehle-koofa ka yehi qol hai. aur baaz ka kehna hai ke jab namaz mein qasdan guftgu karey to namaz dohraaey aur agar bhool sey ya la-ilmi mein guftgu ho jaey to namaz kafi hogi, 4- Shafai isi key qaail hain."
"467","mainey Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ko kehtey suna : main jab Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sey koi hadees sunta to Allah us sey mujhey nafa pahunchata , jitna wo pahunchana chahta. aur jab aap key as-haab mein sey koi aadmi mujh sey bayan karta to main us sey qism leta. ( kya waqae tum ney ye hadees Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sey khud suni hai?) jab wo merey samney qism kha leta to main uski tasdeeq karta, mujh sey abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ney bayan kya aur abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ney sach bayan kya ke mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey suna hai : '' jo shakhs gunah karta hai, phir ja kar wuzu karta hai phir namaz padhta hai, phir Allah sey istighfar karta hai to Allah usey maaf kar deta hai. phir aap ney ye aayat padhi « والذين إذا فعلوا فاحشة والذين إذا فعلوا فاحشة أو ظلموا أنفسهم ذكروا الله فاستغفروا لذنوبهم ومن يغفر الذنوب إلا الله ولم يصروا على ما فعلوا وهم يعلمون ''aur jab un sey koi nashaista harkat ya koi gunah sarzad ho jata hai to wo Allah ko yad kar key fauran istighfar kartey hain. aur Allah key siwa kon gunah bakhsh sakta hai, aur wo jaan-boojh kar kisi gunah par adey nahin rehtey ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan hai, hum isey sirf usi tareeq sey yani Usman bin Mughira hi ki sanad sey jantey hain, 2- aur un sey Shoba aur doosrey aur logon ney bhi riwayat ki hai un logon ney isey abu-Awaana ki hadees ki tarah marfooan riwayat kya hai, aur usey Sufiyan Sory aur musair ney bhi riwayat kya hai lekin un dono ki riwayat maqoof hai marfoo nahin aur musair sey ye hadees marfooan bhi marvi hai aur siwaye is hadees key Asma bin Hakam ki kisi aur marfoo hadees ka hamen ilm nahin, padhi. 3- is bab mein ibne-Masood , abu Darda, Anas , abu-Umama , Muaz , Waasila, aur abul-Yusr Kaab bin Amr (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"468","Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ney farmaya : ''saat baras key bachey ko namaz sikhaao, aur das baras key bachey ko namaz na padhney par maaro''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Sabra bin Maabad Johni (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Abdullah bin Amr Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi riwayat hai, 3- baaz ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai, yehi Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya bhi kehtey hain, unka kehna hai ke '' jo ladka das baras key ho janey key baad namaz chhodey wo uski qaza karey"
"469","Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ney farmaya : '' jab aadmi ko salam pherney sey pehley « hadas » laahiq ho jaey aur wo apni namaz key bilkul aakhir mein yani qaada Akhira mein beth chuka ho to uski namaz durust hai ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- is hadees ki sanad koi khas qawi nahin, iski sanad mein iztirab hai, 2- Abdur-Rehman bin Ziyad bin Anam, jo Afriqi hain ko baaz muhaddeseen ney zaeef qarar diya hai. un mein Yahya bin Saeed Qataan aur Ahmed bin Hanbal bhi shamil hain, 3- baaz ehle-ilm usi taraf gaey hain. wo kehtey hain ke jab koi tashahud ki miqdaar key barabar beth chuka ho aur salam pherney sey pehley usey «hadas» laahiq ho jaey to phir uski namaz puri ho qaee, 4- aur baaz ehle-ilm kehtey hain ke jab « hadas » tashahud padhney sey ya salam pherney sey pehley laahiq ho jaey to namaz dohraaey. Shafai ka yehi qol hai, 5- aur Ahmed kehtey hain : jab wo tashahud na padhey aur salam pher dey to uski namaz usey kafi ho jaeygi, isliye ke Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka irshad hai : « وتحليلها التسليم » yani namaz mein jo cheezen haram hui thin salam pherney hi sey halal hoti hain, baghair salam key namaz sey nahin nikla ja sakta aur tashahud itna aham nahin jitna salam hai ke uskey tarak sey namaz durust na hogi , eik baar Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) do rakat key baad khadey ho gaey apni namaz jari rakhi aur tashahud nahin kya, 6- Is-haq bin Ibrahim bin Raahviya kehtey hain : jab tashahud kar ley aur salam na pheraa ho to namaz ho gaee , unhoney ibne-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees sey istidlaal kya hai ke jis waqt Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ney unhen tashahud sikhaya to farmaya : jab tum us sey farigh ho gaey to tum ney apna fariza pura kar liya."
"470","hum log Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath eik safar mein they ke barish honey lagi to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ney farmaya : '' jo chahey apney derey main hi namaz padh ley ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein ibne-Umar , Samra, abu Maleeh, Aamir ( jinhoney apney baap Usama bin umr Hazl sey riwayat ki hai) aur Abdur-Rehman bin Samra (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain, 3- baaz ehle-ilm ney barish aur keechad mein jamaat mein hazir na honey ki rukhsat di hai, yehi Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya kehtey hain."
"471","Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas kuch faqir o mohtaj log aaye aur kaha : Allah key Rasool ! maaldaar namaz padhtey hain jaisey hum padhtey hain wo roza rakhtey hain jaisey hum rakhtey hain. unkey paas maal bhi hai, us sey wo ghulam azad kartey aur sadqa detey hain? aap ney farmaya : '' jab tum namaz padh chuko to tentees martaba '' subhan Allah '' , tentees martaba '' الحمد لله '' aur tentees martaba '' الله أكبر '' aur das martaba ''la ila-h illallah'' keh liya karo, to tum un logon ko paa logey jo tum par sabqat ley gaey hain, aur jo tum sey peechey hain wo tum par sabqat na ley ja sakengey''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ibne-Abbas Raziallahu anhuma ki hadees Hasan gharib hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Kaab bin Ajra , Anas , Abdullah bin Amr , Zaid bin Sabit , Abu-Darda, ibne-Umar aur Abu-Zar (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain, neez is baab mein Abu-Hurera aur Mughira Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi ahadees aai hain, 3- Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sey ye bhi marvi hai ke aap ney farmaya : '' do aadatein hain jinhen jo bhi musalman aadmi baja layega jannat mein dakhil hoga. eik ye ke wo har namaz key baad das baar '' Subhanallah '' , das baar ''Alhamdulillah'', das baar ''Allahu-akbar'' kahey, doosrey ye ke wo apney sotey waqt tentees martaba '' Subhanallah '' , tentees martaba '' الحمد لله '' aur chauntees martaba '' الله أكبر '' kahey."
"472","wo log eik safar mein Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath they, wo eik tang jagah pahunchey they ke namaz ka waqt aa gaya, ooper sey barish honey lagi , aur nichey keechad ho qaee, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ney apni sawari hi par Azan di aur iqaamat kahi aur sawari hi par aagey badhey aur unhen namaz padhaai , aap ishara sey namaz padhtey they, sajdey mein rukoo sey qadrey ziyada jhuktey they . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai, umr bin Rumaah Balkhi uskey riwayat karney mein munfarid hain. ye sirf unhin ki sanad sey jaani jati hai. aur un sey ye hadees ehle-ilm mein sey kaee logon ney riwayat ki hai, 2- Anas bin Malik sey bhi isi tarah marvi hai ke unhoney pani aur keechad main apni sawari par namaz padhi, 3- aur usi par ehle-ilm ka amal hai. Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya bhi yehi kehtey hain."
"473","Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ney namaz padhi yahan tak ke aap key pair sooj gaey to aap sey arz kya gaya : kya aap aisi zahmat kartey hain halanke aap key agley pichley tamam gunah bakhsh diye gaey hain? to aap ney farmaya : ''kya main shukar guzar banda na banon?'' padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Mughira bin Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Abu-Hurera aur Aaisha Raziallahu anhuma sey ahadees aai hain."
"474","main Madiney aaya : mainey kaha : aey Allah mujhey nek aur Saleh sathi nasib farma , chunanche Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) key paas bethna muyassar ho gaya, mainey un sey kaha : mainey Allah sey dua maangi thi ke mujhey nek sathi ata farma , to aap mujh sey koi aisi hadees bayan kijiye , jisey aap ney Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sey suni ho, shayad Allah mujhey us sey faeyda pahunchaey , unhoney kaha : mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey suna hai : '' qiyamat key roz bandey sey sab sey pehley uski namaz ka muhaasba hoga, agar wo theek rahi to kamiyab ho gaya, aur agar wo kharab nikli to wo nakam aur na-murad raha, aur agar uski farz namazon mein koi kami padhi. hogi to rab taala ( farishton sey) farmaeyga : dekho , merey us bandey key paas koi nafl namaz hai? chunanche farz namaz ki kami ki talafi us nafl sey kar di jaeygi, phir usi andaz sey sarey aamal ka muhaasba hoga ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees is sanad sey Hasan gharib hai, 2- ye hadees deegar aur sanadon sey bhi Abu-Hurera sey riwayat ki gaee hai, 3- Hasan key baaz talaamiza ney Hasan sey aur unhoney Qabisa bin Hures sey is hadees key ilawa dusri aur hadisein bhi riwayat ki hain aur mashhoor Qabisa bin Hures hi hai padhi. , ye hadees b-tareeq : « Anas bin Hakim an abi Hurera an Nabi sallallahu Alehi wasallam » bhi riwayat ki gaee hai, 4- is bab mein Tameem daari (Raziallahu anhu) sey bhi riwayat hai,"
"475","Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ney farmaya : '' jo baara rakat sunnat padhi. par madawmat kerega (hamesha padhega) Allah uskey liye jannat main eik ghar banaeyga : chaar rakatein Zohar sey pehley padhi. , do rakatein uskey baad , do rakatein maghrib key baad , do rakatein Isha key baad aur do rakatein Fajr sey pehley ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) ki hadees is sanad sey gharib hai, 2- sanad mein Mughira bin Ziyad par baaz ehle-ilm ney unkey hifz key talluq sey kalam kya hai, 3- is bab mein Umme-Habiba , Abu-Hurera , abu-Musa aur ibne-Umar (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"476","Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ney farmaya : '' jo shakhs raat aur din mein baara rakat sunnat padheyga, uskey liye jannat main eik ghar banaya jaeyga : chaar rakatein Zohar sey pehley , do rakatein uskey baad, do maghrib key baad , do Isha key baad aur do Fajr sey pehley ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : anbasaa ki hadees jo Umme-Habiba (Raziallahu Anha) sey marvi hai is baab mein Hasan sahih hai. aur wo anbasaa sey deegar aur sanadon sey bhi marvi hai."
"477","Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ney farmaya : '' Fajr ki dono rakatein duniya aur duniya mein jo kuch hai un sab sey behtar hain ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) ki hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Ali , ibne-Umar , aur ibne-Abbas (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain. jinhen Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) un mein padhtey they."
"478","mein Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko eik mahiney tak dekhta raha , Fajr sey pehley ki dono rakaaton mein aap « قل يا أيها الكافرون » aur « قل هو الله أحد » padhtey they . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma ki hadees Hasan hai, 2- aur hum sura ki riwayat ko jisey unhoney Abu-Is'haq sey riwayat ki hai sirf abu-Ahmad Zubairi hi key tareeq sey jantey hain, ( jabke ( logon ( muhaddeseen ( key nazdik maroof « an Israail an abi Is-haq» hai bajaey « Sufiyan abi Is-haq » key, 3- aur abu-Ahmad Zubairi key wastey sey bhi Israel sey riwayat ki gaee hai, 4- abu-Ahmad Zubairi Suqa aur Hafiz hain, mainey Bundaar ko kehtey suna hai ke mainey abu-Ahmad Zubairi sey ziyada achey hafizey wala nahin dekha , abu-Ahmad ka naam Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Zuber koofii Asadi hai, 5- is bab mein ibne-Masood , Anas , Abu-Hurera , ibne-Abbas , Hafsa aur Aaisha (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"479","Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Fajr ki do rakatein padh chuktey aur agar aap ko mujh sey koi kaam hota to (us barey mein) mujh sey guftgu farma letey , warna namaz key liye nikal jatey . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 3- Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey baaz ehle-ilm ney Fajr key tulu honey baad sey ley kar Fajr padhney tak guftgu karna makrooh qarar diya hai, siwaye uskey ke wo guftgu zikre-Ilahi sey mutalliq ho ya bahut zaruri ho, aur yehi Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka bhi qol hai."
"480","Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ney farmaya : '' tulue-Fajr key baad siwaye do rakat (sunnat Fajr) key koi namaz nahin ''. is hadees ka matlab ye hai ke tulu Fajr key baad) farz sey pehley ( siwaye do rakat sunnat key aur koi namaz nahin . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ibne-Umar ki hadees gharib hai, usey hum sirf Qudama bin Musa hi key tareeq sey jantey hain aur un sey kaee logon ney riwayat ki hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Abdullah bin Amr aur Hafsa (Raziallauh anhum) sey ahadees aai hain, 3- aur yehi qol hai jis par ehle-ilm ka ijmaa hai : unhoney tulu Fajr key baad) farz sey pehley ( siwaye Fajr ki dono sunnaton key koi aur namaz padhney ko makrooh qarar diya hai padhi. ."
"481","Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ney farmaya : '' jab tum mein sey koi Fajr ki do rakat ( sunnat ( padhey to daain karwat par letey '' padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees is sanad sey Hasan sahih gharib hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) sey bhi riwayat hai, 3- Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) sey bhi marvi hai ke Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Fajr ki dono rakatein apney ghar mein padhtey to apni daain karwat let'tey , 4- baaz ehle-ilm ki raey hai ke aisa istehbaban kya jaey."
"482","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jab jamaat khadi ho jaey padhi. to farz namaz padhi. ke siwa koi namaz  (jayez) nahin.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan hai. 2- isi tarah eik dusri sanad sey bhi Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey riwayat ki hai. 3- is bab mein ibne Buhena , Abdullah bin Amr , Abdullah bin Sarjis , ibne-Abbas aur Anas (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain. 4- aur Hammad bin Zaid aur Sufiyan bin Uena ney bhi Amr bin Dinar sey riwayat ki hai lekin un dono ney isey marfoo nahin kiya hai aur marfoo hadees hi hamarey nazdik ziyada sahih hai. 5- Sufiyan Sory , ibne-Mubarak , Shafai , Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya isi key qaail hain. 6- iskey ilawa aur (eik teesri) sanad sey bhi ye hadees ba-wasta Abu-Hurera Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey marvi (riwayat hui) hai. aur unhoney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey riwayat ki hai. (jaisey) Ayash bin Abbas Qatbaani Misri abu-Salma sey, aur abu-Salma ney Abu-Hurera sey aur Abu-Hurera ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey isi tarah riwayat ki hai."
"483","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam nikley aur jamaat key liye iqaamat keh di gaee , to mainey aap key sath Fajr padhi , phir Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam paltey to mujhey dekha ke main namaz padhney ja raha hun, to aap ney farmaya : ''Qais zara thehro, kya do namazein eik sath padhi. (padhney ja rahey ho?) ''maine arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! mainey Fajr ki dono sunnatein nahin padhi thin۔ aap ney farmaya : ''tab koi harj nahin.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- hum Muhammad bin Ibrahim ki hadees ko uskey jaisi sirf Saad bin Saeed hi key tareeq sey jantey hain, 2- Sufiyan bin Uena kehtey hain ke Ata bin abi Ribah ney bhi ye hadees Saad bin Saeed sey suni hai. 3- ye hadees mursalan (wo hadees jismein taabaee se upar raavi ka naam milta ho) bhi riwayat ki jati hai. 4- ehale Makka mein sey kuchh logon ney isi hadees key mutabiq kaha hai ke aadmi key Fajr ki farz namaz padhney key baad suraj nikalney sey pehley dono sunnatein padhney mein koi harj nahin. 5- Saad bin Saeed Yahya bin Saeed Ansari ke bhai hain, aur Qais Yahya bin Saeed Ansari ke dada hain. unhen Qais bin Amr bhi kaha jata hai aur Qais bin Qahad bhi. 6- is hadees ki sanad muttasil nahin hai. Muhammad bin Ibrahim Temi ney Qais sey nahin suna hai, baaz logon ney ye hadees Saad bin Saeed sey aur Saad ney Muhammad bin Ibrahim sey riwayat ki hai ke ''nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam nikley to Qais ko dekha.''  aur ye abdul-Azeez ki hadees sey jisey unhoney Saad bin Saeed sey riwayat ki hai ziyada sahih hai."
"484","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jo Fajr ki dono sunnatein na padh sakey to unhen suraj nikalney key baad padh ley.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees hum sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain. 2- ibne-Umar sey ye bhi riwayat ki gaee hai ke unhoney aisa kiya hai. 3- baaz ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai, Sufiyan Sory , ibne-Mubarak , Shafai , Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya bhi isi key qaail hain. 4- hum kisi aisey shakhs ko nahin jantey jisney Hamaam sey ye hadees is sanad sey is tarah riwayat ki ho siwaye Amr bin Aasim Kilaabi key. aur b-tareeq : (Qataada an Nazar bin Anas an Bashir bin Naheek an abi Huraira an Nabi Sallallahu Alehi wasallam) mash'hoor ye hai ke aap ney farmaya : ''jisney Fajr ki eik rakat bhi suraj tulu honey sey pehley pa li to usne Fajr pa li.''"
"485","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam Zohar sey pehley chaar rakatein aur uskey baad do rakatein padhtey they . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Aaisha Raziallahu anhuma aur Umme-Habiba Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi hadeesen aai hain. 3- hum sey abu-Bakar Attaar ney bayan kiya hai wo kehtey hain ke Ali bin Abdullah ney Yahya bin Saeed sey aur Yahya ney Sufiyan sey riwayat ki hai ke wo kehtey they ke hum jantey they ke aiAasim bin Zamra ki hadees Haris  (Aa'war) ki hadees sey afzal hai. 4- Sahaba kiram aur baad key logon mein sey aksar ehal ka amal isi par hai. wo ba-sand kartey hain ke aadmi Zohar sey pehley chaar rakatein padhey"
"486","mainey Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key sath Zohar sey pehley do rakatein padhi. aur uskey baad do rakatein padhin. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- is baab mein Ali (Raziallahu anhu) aur Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain. 2- ibne-Umar ki hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"487","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam jab Zohar sey pehley chaar rakatein na padh paatey to unhen aap uskey baad padhtey. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai. 2- hum isey ibne-Mubarak ki hadees sey sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain. aur isey Qais bin Rabee ney Shoba sey aur Shoba ney Khalid  sey isi tarah riwayat kiya hai. aur hum Qais bin Rabee key ilawa kisi aur ko nahin jantey jisney Shoba sey riwayat ki ho. 3- b-atareeq : (Abdur-Rehman bin abi Lela an Nabi Sallallahu Alehi wasallam) bhi isi tarah (mursalan) marvi (riwayat hui) hai."
